#: ../../chapter11.rst:3
msgid "Upgrade CentreStack"
msgstr "Opgrader CentreStack"

#: ../../chapter11.rst:5
msgid ""
"We publish updated notes to our public blog forum called `CentreStack "
"Blog`_. It is recommended that you perform an update if your self-hosted "
"CentreStack and clients are three months or older."
msgstr "Vi offentliggør opdaterede noter på vores offentlige blogforum kaldet `CentreStack Blog`_. Det anbefales, at du udfører en opdatering, hvis din selvhostede CentreStack og klienter er tre måneder eller ældre."

#: ../../chapter11.rst:8
msgid "Using the GUI Installer to Upgrade"
msgstr "Brug af GUI-installationsprogrammet til opgradering"

#: ../../chapter11.rst:10
msgid ""
"To install an update go to your `Partner Portal`_ (Self-Hosted "
"CentreStack -> Download) and download the GUI installer."
msgstr "For at installere en opdatering skal du gå til dit `Partner Portal`_ (Self-Hosted CentreStack -> Download) og downloade GUI-installationsprogrammet."

#: ../../chapter11.rst:14
msgid ""
"When you run the GUI installer, it will detect the existing installation "
"and perform an upgrade."
msgstr "Når du kører GUI-installationsprogrammet, vil det opdage den eksisterende installation og udføre en opgradering."

